          "content": "**B**\n\n**Explanation:** \nSociety B offers the highest expected level of overall well-being. Because the vast majority of people at nearly every tier enjoy a higher quality of life and greater opportunities to flourish, the total amount of welfare and human happiness generated is significantly greater than in Society A. Choosing the option that maximizes the aggregate good across the entire population yields the best overall outcome.",
